{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0454a1a956f016996da3bb6648df3118b04301b0467fb30c7fece5e0ece4ab5b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b13cfb4e25c42cd664c86854e3c00b8899970389342c9081118e4b118a84298b",
      "text": "决意之夜",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4c2471ffcae26ea22f55ae38b8ab5b5daba466abdd96b8cf8731accdaee9520",
      "text": "决定以组合形式展开活动后，\n龙、英雄和诚司三人打算兼顾联谊会与动员会一起吃顿饭。\n聚集在诚司家的3人，再次畅谈起各自成为偶像的理由、\n过去，以及内心的真实想法……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_a:cmd-000019:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:851f32e78985f5b441d8d086b8782f09b00f4cc9633468b884231e293ac344f8",
      "text": "第4话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_a:cmd-000019:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b13cfb4e25c42cd664c86854e3c00b8899970389342c9081118e4b118a84298b",
      "text": "决意之夜",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9199f531698813884ff8641765698ecb423a08a782a9120cf477bc051fc07bcb",
      "text": "为了迎接出道，各位暂时需要\n进行声乐和舞蹈的课程训练。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c8a5953e801d4c19d1772cf444aaaa441184427ae33996ab81c833aa5a6b3fb",
      "text": "另外还要拍摄宣传照，\n具体日程之后会联系各位。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4080701b2e365039194d3a3e14ded44c6c0a00fe0157fca0c5ca7bd7d3ae57ac",
      "text": "宣传照……！\n真的很有偶像的感觉了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8346746871ca7d433ac37545cd353ed4d8ed4a2d5532ad3e392ee2f9d64c842b",
      "text": "哈哈。我们本来就是要成为偶像嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b7eddf44c5be95e07cdca2f84300c129c52b0c4c0645848f6c38197ece91d86",
      "text": "说明就先到这里，\n最后，还有一项最重要的通知。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15599711ef9b8b3fe6ed54e7b5eaf8f8582be76253419aefe0d3c77c99e70a7e",
      "text": "只要是我力所能及的，尽管交给我吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_a:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55ce8cde215a00a18cc28fed2d137b41569c027b5dbac9f15c81403971a7d51c",
      "text": "好的。\n握野英雄先生、木村龙先生、信玄诚司先生……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78bdc3c1605b81e94674822efe3d57d118094b9ea1981f7c0dce99ef8bdcf11e",
      "text": "今后，三位将\n作为一个组合展开活动！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_a:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac2f4b4558ed37469f5fb7031304e80b45a98f1f4e60bad696ae06612f4f0369",
      "text": "我们3个人吗？\n完全没预料到……不过听起来挺有意思的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_a:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:866118b95c91f36f56ace4f30cbf3af0b16968699a4d403a31674a2a8351a006",
      "text": "嗯。\n要是我们3个人的话，一定能相处得很好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_a:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d71b4d310a732a39a1d04c69b10fd303a8098ca962adb434a14bd6a649febc6",
      "text": "好！和诚司先生还有英雄先生一起做偶像啊……\n我对今后的生活越来越期待了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fef83c88c3fb25de0f1b841431a4c24eed1d0113387aac447a45e53305b70572",
      "text": "今天的说明就到此为止。\n今后就请大家多多关照了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:033f7be18e9b9ff324ace80a37fa8967638f1712dc09a7bd36147111ac821d43",
      "text": "请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:841e9af699175035a692a5fadb37720b1a549a800bc3dd24271928a4381d1817",
      "text": "（这就是梦想的起点啊。\n为了把歌声传递给孩子们……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ee09ff235adc251cbbeafd6ee1e33eba7377d8e70fdc8546d1a3d034fafdb26",
      "text": "（成为一日消防署长。为了这个……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_b:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f18f74e00b93dbb487783aa0a223ab4b85af91c4d4c17722f9bf767b6d55654",
      "text": "（为了守护全世界的笑容，迈出的第一步。\n……得赶快告诉天音和妹妹才行）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_b:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:caaaf6b6cce5cd6d0bfc9582d87e900efaa5fb46cf8fe48a514ee3756a480319",
      "text": "我们真的要成为偶像了呢……\n在训练开始前，必须把体力练好才行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_b:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ea2f09652bf7b3a07b2a341e114e84d48acc929a1fcf447f2d338e57b749ccd",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_b:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06e954c16896a93c470040539843bd1d1aa6e67102443762ffff16a713bb57b6",
      "text": "两位，能稍微听我说两句吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_b:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e68e85e8c84cf567cef2fab412993b6ce1d213450d98f02828b0934901739966",
      "text": "我有个提议……\n既然好不容易决定了要组成3人组合。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_b:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e01deedbc00e648eefacc5df5ab154b4f0a62da2d8a72521c38f74c2c2b660ee",
      "text": "不如兼作联谊会和动员会，一起去吃个饭怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_b:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d3a3a2877188de660f03dcde89a089d7620f3e48641bb3e1cb82c5e7f0775f2",
      "text": "哦，不错嘛！\n我也赞成。正好也有想聊聊的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_b:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07f36fe2dda5db407119a6cf7185e909941b75524cbfc6d67a8e275615ff07fc",
      "text": "好主意！\n那我们现在顺便去家庭餐厅吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_b:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4391cfee1f454820c0ec30b88ed255f26d565b55e77e4d138dd17ef9b0cd2348",
      "text": "这样的话，方便的话改天到我家\n来怎么样？由我来做菜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56285b00a18c1d2d2163cb0e49d50a30a530e2d4cce2c7f77ebba6f6dfe2b428",
      "text": "可以吗？\n地点和做饭都全包给你了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e93177f86fe94a7d4dc4caa95cbd9735c0bbc6ac170ca07e01bcebaf11669f0c",
      "text": "嗯，当然可以。不用客气。\n我平时也经常自己做饭。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01722f54ab434d67b354aabbab86a452276bf1ac35758e2249e316fb715f3a8d",
      "text": "而且，我也想不用顾虑时间，\n和大家坐下来慢慢聊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39399a767ddb6b6baa22343c32877a7d7500b3f2efdba2446e36778b897520cb",
      "text": "那务必打扰了！\n好期待诚司先生做的料理啊～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_c:cmd-000060:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_c:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92a8c4638dba8c813ad9d03a80d014060a8995c226da83669b6cf1228cac35b8",
      "text": "味道……嗯，做得不错。\n再稍微焖一会儿吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_c:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9a81b41a8fe6e8cde003608271b7962314d3d30e7bd6a34f1e22ace6e5c9e02",
      "text": "好香啊～。\n天音也想快点吃！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_c:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:381d66c19358059c7da3d5eb13316e2e48f0cd7e3d3f50774aad46a81ef64549",
      "text": "等客人来了再吃。……好啦。\n还想再做一道菜……肉还有剩。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_c:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5137db0d5943f44d960f3158d3fd6ce3dfc8a52b701f596c377a384cbdc69352",
      "text": "你们好！我是龙。\n英雄先生也一起来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_c:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c3a8d561a194f38f7be2d0258a856521027a31531cfb3a9046b48183d954281",
      "text": "抱歉天音，舅舅现在有点腾不开手，\n能替我去开个门吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_c:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ac5833e3cdc3d7f955615613a985e95e8892e2b8b39873204e9d05b8d81480b",
      "text": "好～的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_c:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8286f80855548deb23d7909d076f4532cca8db8a42e2d27d12cfbcdef83daa8b",
      "text": "欢迎光临！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_c:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee85c8311a4feb1ab87f1df707db9c2aed08c74d182fd01f09fc08d7b3d3b826",
      "text": "嗯！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_c:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd814d1c96c43fbd50257d99bb8ab51c1de7a73d4fdf223615b88b479b05bdfd",
      "text": "啊……你好……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:548a5e8f6b51662b13d1972a06cc7f2fc5cd59fb783ee1843403d770eabfba9f",
      "text": "你们两个欢迎光临！\n行李随便放在空地方就好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_d:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:322f703b5a51753e7e034151dfad6475705beb913c5b700f96e81293156acfb7",
      "text": "哦、哦哦。\n这个，是我和龙带的慰劳品。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3644322fed6b10d06a7659887466f7e38f0e1fd81c3982655e24f6721b58dc0f",
      "text": "哦，谢谢你们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0f1b45e7ced9ec234c8b4d13d7d1d49e72855eb8696782230c1de39c9799b0e",
      "text": "诚司先生，原来您有孩子啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_d:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f109d3e4c51a18568c255dc071fad49fc400d072a63d310bce27e2a68e292c1b",
      "text": "啊。这孩子是我外甥女天音。妹妹夫妇有急事\n出门了，所以托我照看一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48fa793827bad82ce67d2f612403dbd168e490103cddb824bd23c96db8178bd4",
      "text": "你们好。\n初次见面，我是天音！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_d:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:214bf4edd24d58afeb72e32c946cf3ec32231c7cc2448401426610cd0728c5a0",
      "text": "什么啊，原来是这么回事。吓我一跳。\n我是握野英雄。要和你舅舅一起当偶像了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_d:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9009e4d5946f241dcc0aace229816e3cb52539dc305ac72789be3d9aa1d7508",
      "text": "我是木村龙，请多关照哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_d:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e5674ea9194cc8a693e7d77a8f2fbd2e82e9d09345b63fecfc8eccae8e606b1",
      "text": "请、请多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_d:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7158d0c99143adaf08c583afbb4dd5db24df37d8050a3cb556d163609ce86a1c",
      "text": "怎么了，天音？\n突然躲起来……啊，原来是这样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_d:cmd-000160:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1fd07e0f8f3e33ba001b2879a99261f9b0d003a7a67152de46a01409b860b3df",
      "text": "龙。不好意思，你能尽量别太\n靠近天音吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_d:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c071478ec52ad87772975071896a7dba2a121a01fcee72481ab299b952527efb",
      "text": "哎！？为什么啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_d:cmd-000179:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:092964831750819dfc8f9cda7eccab347b57e536813d6755c8ad5aa0ccbf012f",
      "text": "哈哈。天音酱说不定\n会成为我们的粉丝呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3749ef628f298d4188375087aab059868fd304b5f3c9120747d0ab5c192c77fb",
      "text": "接天音的人也来了，\n那我们差不多开始吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f2ea2b7c0ff63d3f233e308f2d2c9e97bcf397fcc4687a1956023a438efcae3",
      "text": "冒昧由我来带个头。\n为了庆祝我们3人合格……干杯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:835e259d586a3e8c41754723ba555b83374b1a238f0b5535308202003fa19f24",
      "text": "干杯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:732c2dc704396ca498e3003ed5fb18a982e03a4f60fbb727f7403ee1f23e7cca",
      "text": "……嗯！好吃！\n这道下酒菜跟啤酒简直太搭了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09c7d83885148b38698202864f2097caac68f66193e81d97cb5fa3723e7fc7bb",
      "text": "是啊。\n诚司先生做的菜，每一样都好好吃！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77a6631bd1178689e5612a6b4d5e0e741e81a8d7ecb33dfdf90417a82289de4a",
      "text": "谢谢。嘛，家务我都做习惯了，\n自己做饭也很多年了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8289ab8021732b943dec5cf7de4124ffea5386da9d4cc585e7b6d6b9a5027361",
      "text": "这样啊。诚司先生一个人住了很久呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_e:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d1210983c9fb3103e4d633838f0f538f7a498853dcf4ca99f0c320301bdb1c4",
      "text": "应该说，我第一次见到你的时候\n你就是大人了……这么想也是理所当然的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_e:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:887aeb3d6f253eedac793822233239313f4fd8a98302f5491d569875328b4085",
      "text": "说起来，龙和信玄\n很久以前就认识了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_e:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bbc7a4245431a038dcb485a3455978ddda19ff6f22749fe6c825d98e4e96285",
      "text": "跟我详细讲讲呗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_e:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e224ed03a78bcf4559a487ee9596dbc2c86ad0441cd229677c1fabb430179a2a",
      "text": "当然可以！\n呃……那大概是我16岁的时候吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_e:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28d46d59bed37b5fb75d0456979a531252b71ce0129d902ed295f1c69eb252e6",
      "text": "我和家人一起去了自卫队的火力演习场，\n那时候好像出了点小乱子……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_f:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57a5677bb622a8c6358f1366e1c8b394fb039ac527e934c50768c1ad54acdacf",
      "text": "数年前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_f:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0243d3f25c0370b5ffda5374114ecbea14d0686aed79e2bff9829510bd52d3a4",
      "text": "情况怎么样了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_f:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fce88484782f86d0947d1a57356b1f68f0a023596c772b655457c303f81732c4",
      "text": "已经确认安全。\n应该不会再发生进一步的问题了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_f:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d54f9d17130b1e48da4d725850432ad0c60b1024a1de9ff38e7c075ee4358c60",
      "text": "但是，事故就是事故。\n演习不能再继续下去了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_f:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b820290b8eadf9e9e17072075e1d68556298c970a4c5002f6f344cf5d866a18",
      "text": "请确保疏散通道。\n让参与者撤离到设施外面去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_f:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d80dcf567869b6df59c7fb9863926bbb48adeadf1441ae11d6bbfe42e632e42",
      "text": "了解！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_f:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e99fb55b234cf7cd2763d348a00488b97987cdb763e165890ff838ce258f30f4",
      "text": "民众的疏散引导由我来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_f:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ece6d3699f2dc5d59b686b810e07d120eb2f8c3d97b836f153341bcd192b23df",
      "text": "大家冷静一点！\n自卫官也说了，没有危险。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_f:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9828269a1491fefeeb71c9759326b22261f7eabfc704eb647ccc0cdee12cb9d",
      "text": "请先听从指示。\n……我来帮忙疏散，去看看那边的孩子！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_f:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcfb0f2c0887a70fd28c28e9202a21d03b63a629a28aedfd84f8b7dd45e7619e",
      "text": "那个少年是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_g:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb98a5bd06fa1ced56e2a7191e6c93ed2e9adfd3f7beb817d28d9ab7e4a0c9ca",
      "text": "那个时候，我真的很佩服你能那么\n迅速地行动起来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_g:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47e29214ff063d03cc95e1a526653ddc1f1071b4d6286cbb23dcd0b3d53ecb48",
      "text": "哎呀……虽然当时拼尽了全力。\n但正因为那件事，才有了现在的我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_g:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28e6b836f1a82c99ece5c6ab3c605f05853c3616253d91a3eb4d68f5a217a17e",
      "text": "看到诚司先生为了大家四处奔走的身影，\n我也想为了别人去工作……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_g:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df9fcd1bcabef48741f8f4fa2019ee5d9da0d4861cbc352c1d38d9efc7ea4fb2",
      "text": "想成为消防员的心情，\n就变得更强烈了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_g:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eba749821e7b101268ade98edae4499b7d24e9ad174ec0463464e3b181c26c76",
      "text": "这不是挺好的故事嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_g:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bed6b8b80e5ee945b99efec5be3c015177c7984fdee535c18870cef90545da52",
      "text": "哎，虽然发生了各种各样的事，\n最后还是不得不辞职了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_g:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c3a4127199b38d316fe1406d03091dd3d7722e63b6e8461ef9f2f1321936014",
      "text": "不过，没关系！\n今后我会和两位一起努力做好偶像的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_g:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b98a33ef361d76261c0bc5ba2cfffcdfdaa128f6209687d24631d50c68784b3d",
      "text": "然后总有一天要当上消防署长……呜呜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_g:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a34b4f7061c1d2cdbf4c797bd1aab41fa2cae4b39dd791c2fe268e95112ec0d7",
      "text": "嗯。一起加油吧。\n还有你差不多该喝口水了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_g:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f5dbcf000632203f1c290c80c5b2a7f837c751f2ff788a56f308bc0c101ae2d",
      "text": "呜呜，太温柔了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_g:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18d0219adc27b0d9830f0af50d1813aa1fb87e77ccd4e750070a60996eca4700",
      "text": "……嘛，无论谁身上都会发生各种各样的事嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_h:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e79f46974300cee8436689d2e6ff2e8657a8dbacc3a7b6c9a1ab1b57d1685b5",
      "text": "英雄先生在决定成为偶像之前，\n也经历过很多事情吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_h:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cc77fa0b8a749b7e349e74f4022f207f4ba8b84032cca80c848dffd1e0a532d",
      "text": "差不多吧。我小的时候，\n曾经被警察救过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_h:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f5ee95336c1ea779d1dab05d8aa15d7eb4c25f125c21008a501a5755ff576fe",
      "text": "从那以后就很崇拜警察。\n我也希望自己能去帮助别人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_h:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06c2a544a124e9c976e0c9dc1e90fb9c938a9a717101edc461ddc42e1bb84e04",
      "text": "我一直想着，总有一天要向救过我的那个人道谢。\n……虽然现在还没能遇上。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_h:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c88c1caca17c9b103c6a9d7476520ff89ecb3cf35f73a69c154b3f4aede42832",
      "text": "这样啊。希望能早点遇上。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_h:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:736b6ed718223b2673669456c86832fac4f156abc2e6ac8c92fd3dc9e798a4b6",
      "text": "嗯。然后当上警察之后，我才知道\n世上还有很多无处可去的孩子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_h:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a588d9c5d3f58272943189f8a40a7ac89bbab710c4199e863e5632f8097054fd",
      "text": "我想把歌声传递给那些家伙，\n告诉他们并不孤单……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_h:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbc84b11aa8e045ea0b94a9fd1ffe0aa00d10926fc650ae06aec6b3b51a74278",
      "text": "看到执勤时发现的偶像试镜海报，\n就忍不住立刻报名了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_h:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba16c32a6e2c99a161b2b1271e5c0c62aac828e7ae17d39bc707f317001dc392",
      "text": "呜……这是多么感人的故事啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_h:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75fb384f0ed60a3600794f23c081cde99a2ca30ee8edd1666cd8598fd54402dd",
      "text": "是啊。\n英雄的梦想也让我们一起去实现吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_h:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d4e11f0f489e93b0e50e83629843c80787d5757444ec2ec74386539ba89e716",
      "text": "那么，接下来让我们请出他们！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_h:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56e047e4065e2a8769d87e4bd5282b5e4e56b33e436d491cbc01f763ff5fc3d4",
      "text": "嗯？他们是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_i:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1446f17a834fa3401a7e100de25f6613171d630e6fc2558fef25547a744de4e",
      "text": "“和真君”在音乐节目上登场了啊。\n天音说过的就是这个吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_i:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74b320488e00fc0e2ef68b66bf8d73219a2e19cde0e3806d096859e249321d73",
      "text": "天音酱很喜欢偶像吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_i:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8e6b629d2ed9f45724c5fd7561622c1cba7e1d3424ab6f0773519374bf30764",
      "text": "嗯。正是因为看到天音看偶像的样子，\n我才立志成为偶像的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_i:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29578f14e44e648669c156f2ebdaef1fd663f850f45bc9853f912b51d477fafe",
      "text": "天音在看电视的时候，笑得真的很幸福……\n真得好好感谢他们才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_i:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff723efbb312cea0c8d5aa92a0e12d6e80e242fdaed16a82eb7b23fabc673f15",
      "text": "虽说听过你是以天音酱的笑容为契机……\n没想到原来是这群偶像啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_i:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea1afc57a3c19ba9362fdeb6011746a8b6db700559549e8de77f069ed9464f48",
      "text": "偶像一定是守护笑容的存在。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_i:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b84044a7f0d01dda514f973936b02374919cc1ac3f2e6261801bbcb5edd771c",
      "text": "我也想成为能够守护全世界的笑容的……\n那种存在。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_i:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5213b5dfb78cae17ccba8ff8532a59d1a94baf2618940e8d9b3ecbf080447e08",
      "text": "虽然不知道我们能不能变得像他们一样，\n甚至能不能做到也是未知数……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_i:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de709ed90e997d5fcdd6ce975103e92a33cae1fdec7a7dd1d13f7a170ef28d29",
      "text": "但为了把歌声传达给更多的人，努力加油吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_i:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201",
      "text": "好！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_i:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2eb11cf5deb20c0788c799adfda664bdf27a6fdedc299f9446a4a3e433390289",
      "text": "哦。重申一下，今后请多关照啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_j:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1db2cdca56d935be477fab77ea6c6af855436862018821961a739313328b70ff",
      "text": "好。资料的准备就到此为止。\n等三位到达之后，首先进行碰头会……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_j:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:998ae0176332896f2d591e274fd4002d4a01756c60644184f87208d9779af506",
      "text": "……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_j:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d781758a3a86ae99b9b6a44a0beb15afca0e0a4b76749f0646e750e863ac522a",
      "text": "话说回来，信玄做的菜真好吃啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_j:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1289d09ed837e459609f2d97e2d23e5e0a15021acc2533dacbd7801f69b8fe19",
      "text": "就是说啊！\n好吃到我都想每天吃了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_j:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9c7bc14f0e713f05ee4ea161c7145a6479643cdd217154854f2ed2d8c59cd92",
      "text": "哈哈，谢谢。\n随时欢迎你们来吃。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_j:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86e0ad77d85b1e34871fb22d4f711f0e53727460a43f34bdcb0e80d7312a8075",
      "text": "太好啦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_j:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04c07158b535e02b951a60f575e158b2b702d4f3d352397b417a92e276122135",
      "text": "（呵呵，关系真好啊。\n竟然这么快就打成一片了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_j:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e361b98f5b7d4507a3aa85e48258b39183da4121c8e9c4ee9a9b8d9f6f2e9609",
      "text": "（这3个人的话，一定\n能成为一个绝妙的组合……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_j:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fe2f92a38b084cf3eddadf273eefd439af4b9a8056b637d345f7dc574934413",
      "text": "辛苦了，制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
